Z||000000||mrfixit58||03-26-2001||03:59 PM||||Te first link is of my blue 87 GT. It won second place in the Street Stock catagory. I'm VERY proud of this car and already have plans for next year to GO FOR THE GOLD!<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=446733&a=12289178&p=44853971&Sequence=0&res=high" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=446733&a=12289178&p=44853971&Sequence=0&res=high</A> <P>Here is a link to my PhotoPoint album for more pics and discriptions. Pictures include not only my car but an 87 GT with only 1,800 miles, convertible N* GT, and some overall area pictures.<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=446733&a=12289178&f=0" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=446733&a=12289178&f=0</A> <P>To all you Pennock's members... I'm sorry I didn't get to mee very many of you. I was so busy with judging and suffering through a terrible sinus head-ache that I left for the hotel soon after judging. I did get to say "hello" to Phil and meet FieroLisa (you single guys missed out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ) and judged Alex4mula's car. To the rest, please post a picture of your car so I can ID you.<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||6
