Z||000023||Fierodave2001||04-04-2001||03:21 PM||||Hi, Dave here,  -  Blue 87GT - (1700 miles)<P>I was wondering when I'd see some posting about my car.  I haven't see many photos of it. Check here for a few:<BR>This first one, I just love.<BR>  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=446733&a=12289178&p=44853966&Sequence=0&res=high" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=446733&a=12289178&p=44853966&Sequence=0&res=high</A>  <BR> <BR>or <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.sunline.net/showroom/dave" TARGET=_blank>www.sunline.net/showroom/dave</A> <P>Hope those that check it out enjoy it. I'd like to say Hi to those I met at the show. It was a joy being with so many Fiero owners that love their cars.  It really was a shock to win Best of stock group, best stock paint and Best of show. <P>Holy cow, I almost passed out durning the awards anouncment.  What in the world I was<BR>trying to say at the microphone I don't know.<P>I'm very proud to have my car selected - proud for all the Fiero owners.  I hope<BR>all were not upset it placed so well.<P>Some sites have not shown the Best of show, with these paths, those that want can check it out.<P>Hope I made some friends that day.        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I've owned it since Sept 86 when I ordered it.  Did own a 84 4cyl coupe, then an 85 V6  SE coupe.  I enjoyed those to the max.  This GT from day one, when I first saw it at the dealer, I knew it was a keeper. I've had 14 years of loving it !<P>Hope to hear from some of my new friends.      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">!<P>Thank you.<P>       <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrfixit58:<BR><B>Thanks for the nice comments Wolfhound (Coy),<P>Fortunatly, I wasn't compeating against the 1,800 mile GT. He was in the "Stock" group while I competed in the "Street Stock" group. What I did find interesting is when I compaired my VIN with the 1,800 mile car's VIN. His car was made only 46 cars before mine. Probably made the same week.<P>As far as fun factor goes, in the nine months I've owned my blue GT, I put twice as many miles on her then he has in 14 years! I would venture to say that I've had more fun "in" my car then he has         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> .<P>Roy         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><p>[This message has been edited by Fierodave2001 (edited 04-16-2001).]||||reg||9
